{title: Kaash Kite Oh Beete Vele Mud Aawan}
{artist: Kanth Kaler}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Kaash kitey oh beetay vele [C]mudh aawan
[Dm]Kaash kitey oh beetay vele [C]mudh aawan,        Assi [A#]pher raahan vich
[C]khadiye jithon [Dm]tu langey,        Assi [A#]pher raahan vich
[C]khadiye jithon [Dm]tu langey,        [Dm]Chan to sohneya sajna,
chan to sohneya sajna tenu [C]takne layi,        Assi [A#]pher bahane
[C]kariye jithon [Dm]tu langey,        Assi [A#]pher raahan vich
[C]khadiye jithon [Dm]tu langey,        [Dm]Ohi hove [C]chaa borh di [Dm]chaa wargi
[Dm]Ohi teri [C]na ni chaniye [Dm]haan wargi,        [Dm]Ohi hove [C]chaa borh di [Dm]chaa wargi
[Dm]Ohi teri [C]na ni chaniye [Dm]haan wargi,        [Dm]Aa poore kariye [C]vaade,
[Dm]poore kariye vaade reh [C]adhoore jo,        Ni main [A#]dede devanga
[C]jaan je tu [Dm]dil mange,        Ni main [A#]dede devanga
[C]jaan je tu [Dm]dil mange,        [Dm]Oh mere dildaara dara,
bin tere na guzara zara,        [Dm]Oh mere dildaara dara,
bin tere na guzara zara,        [Dm]Jad tu mela [C]vekhan jaave [Dm]sakhiyan naal
[Dm]Chori chori [C]gal samjhave [Dm]akhiyan naal
[Dm]Jad tu mela [C]vekhan jaave [Dm]sakhiyan naal
[Dm]Chori chori [C]gal samjhave [Dm]akhiyan naal,        Main [Dm]pher ohi rang [C]paanva,
[Dm]pher ohi rang paanva ni [C]jehda tu chaanve,        Ni tu [A#]pher meri pagg
[C]wargi chunni [Dm]lai range,        Ni tu [A#]pher meri pagg
[C]wargi chunni [Dm]lai range range,        [Dm]Pind padaane [C]phirda honva [Dm]main kalla
[Dm]Tu sangdi sangdi [C]phad lai mere [Dm]to challa
[Dm]Pind padaane [C]phirda honva [Dm]main kalla
[Dm]Tu sangdi sangdi [C]phad lai mere [Dm]to challa
[Dm]Jad mudh mudh takkdi [C]apne,        [Dm]mudh mudh takkdi apne ghar da [C]mod mude
Te meri [A#]mukdi jaandi,        [C]jaan nu sooli [Dm]tu tangey
Te meri [A#]mukdi jaandi,        [C]jaan nu sooli [Dm]tu tangey
[Dm]Kaash kitey oh, [C]kaash kitey [Dm]oh,        [Dm]Kaash kitey oh [C]beetay vele mudh [Dm]aawan
